{"title":"Dragonscale Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 48) · Monster drop: Baby Red Dragon, Young Red Dragon, Thak Footman, Thak Spearman, Moonhart +10 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · INT/MAG 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 48 <span class=\"muted\">(2602 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/dragonscale-knick\">Dragonscale Knick</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"red-dragon\" title=\"Embermaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embermaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"harpy-broodmother\" title=\"The Broodmother - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d4f85c8142062804f4e8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Broodmother</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimewing\" title=\"Rimewing - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8c3a3c351144b327cb83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimewing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-dragonslayer\" title=\"Virikh Dragonslayer - dropped it in 1 of 24 looted corpses (1/24)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7d40b95a4d9390b47b9c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Drag