cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,192<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dragonscale-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-crude\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=good\">Good <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=superior\">Superior <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"dragonscale-arms\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\"