arms?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>1.2 armor · 3.2 magic defense</td><td>30% blows · 52% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">7 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>1.3 armor · 3.5 magic defense</td><td>32% blows · 55% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">7 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>1.4 armor · 3.8 magic defense</td><td>34% blows · 57% spells</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-arms?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>1.5 armor · 4 magic defense</td><td>35% blows · 58% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Crude ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Tailoring 48): the higher above 48 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"dragonscale-arms\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></